  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>For concentration cell&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi>cell</mi><munder><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></munder></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Anode :&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Cu</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mi>Cu</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced><mi>aq</mi></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math></p><p>Cathode :&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Cu</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced><mi>aq</mi></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>Cu</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Overall :&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><msup><mi>Cu</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced><mi>aq</mi></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mi>Cu</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced><mi>aq</mi></mfenced></mrow><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math></p><p>As&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;G</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>nF</mi><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi>cell</mi></msub></math></p><p>If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;G</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>ve</mi></math>&nbsp;then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi>cell</mi></msub></math>&nbsp;is positive.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi>cell</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi>cell</mi><munder><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></munder></msubsup><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.059</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>log</mi><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi>cell</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.059</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>log</mi><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi>cell</mi></msub><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#62;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math></p>"
